   "body": "### Capture result\nCorpus: `R70b`; PR #386 (`capture/session-expiry`).\n`forum1f.php?owntopic=1` with a stale `md_passs` answers **the same bytes as the home page** (`R70a`): 200, `.hop` \"Identifiants invalides !\", refresh to `/unlog.php`. It is not a list or a login wall. Logged out, the page is the `R12` `.hop` \"Aucun sujet que vous avez lu n'est connu\". Legacy raises `FavoritesLoadError` on it (oracle `LOT-002/R70b`).\nChanges: LOT-092 (#184), LOT-141, #383.",
